abstract: "Three open CSV datasets modeling 2026/27 HMRC and Scottish Government tax rules: the £100,000-£125,140 Personal Allowance taper (62% England / 69.5% Scotland marginal rate), Scotland vs England tax divergence across £25k-£200k, and Inside vs Outside IR35 contractor retention from £350 to £1,000/day."
